{"id":"f5pbku96gep3t8zy9uxl2k3zd","title":"如何在AI时代保持写作的核心能力","originalTitle":"AI时代，如何保持自我写作的核心能力","summary":"写作的核心能力包括问题意识、证据意识、结构能力、语境适配与责任意识。AI擅长语言润色和结构模板化，但难以替代深度思考、证据判断和伦理责任。保持核心能力的关键在于保留认知主权，将高价值环节留给自己，低价值环节交给AI，并通过制度化修改与核验防止“认知卸载”。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1561589"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T01:39:28.673Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T01:39:28.673Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}